WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.397
Sixteen thousand, two hundred and sixty-five killed.

00:00:03.397 --> 00:00:04.443
A new record.

00:00:04.443 --> 00:00:07.602
Five point zero five percent of all deaths.

00:00:07.602 --> 00:00:12.420
One in every nineteen point eight Canadians who died, died because the government killed them.

00:00:12.420 --> 00:00:13.465
And still.

00:00:13.465 --> 00:00:14.932
Zero charges.

00:00:14.932 --> 00:00:16.750
Zero investigations.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.329
Zero accountability.
